Bot1.Hand.Mutavault.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Thespian's Stage.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Mutavault; Ability: copy of target)
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
