Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mutavault#2.Types = Land
Bot1.Battlefield.Mutavault#2.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Plains; Ability: copy of target)
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#1.Subtypes = Plains
